<title>NORWAY: TABLE-AKER MARITIME H1 PRE-TAX DOWN 29 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-AKER MARITIME H1 PRE-TAX DOWN 29 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>				 (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Operating profit		  96	vs	151</p>
<p>  Pre-tax profit		    94	vs	133</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian offshore services company is Aker Maritime ASA. The company was formed in November, 1996, after Aker ASA spun off its Oil and Gas Technology division and merged it with offshore supplier Maritime Group.  </p>
<p>  Operating revenues	   6,056	vs    4,935</p>
<p>  Net profit			  47	vs	 89</p>
<p>  EPS H1 (crowns)		 0.83	 vs    1.58</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
